      <activity id="60e6aa85-fee3-5857-ada4-17891cda5c84" activityNameId="55401fdc-7903-5df0-9fc0-40528ffc03c2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, thermal insulation, 60mm, 40kg/m3, reinforced alumium foil</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, thermal insulation, 60mm, 40kg/m3, reinforced alumium foil
Disposal of a thermal insulation of ventilation duct, made of 40 kg/m3 rock wool, insulation thickness 60 mm, total weight: 3.2 kg/m2. Including cover with a reinforced aluminium facing and stainless steel wire mesh. Reference value of inventory is m2 area of duct surface.;
UUID: bfa7b0bb-bc72-4bee-bb82-9d59154010a3
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bfa7b0bb-bc72-4bee-bb82-9d59154010a3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
